22:["$","section","5-Questions worth sending to admissions",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-6","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Questions worth sending to admissions"}],[["$","p","Instead of asking whether BTEC is accepted in general, provide the full award title and course code. State whether the grade is predicted or achieved and list the other qualifications you would combine. This gives the admissions team enough context to answer the actual offer question.",{"children":"Instead of asking whether BTEC is accepted in general, provide the full award title and course code. State whether the grade is predicted or achieved and list the other qualifications you would combine. This gives the admissions team enough context to answer the actual offer question."}],["$","p","A useful message asks whether the named qualification meets the stated route, whether certain units are essential, and whether an additional A level is required. Keep the response with the course requirements rather than replacing your evidence with a self-calculated tariff total.",{"children":"A useful message asks whether the named qualification meets the stated route, whether certain units are essential, and whether an additional A level is required. Keep the response with the course requirements rather than replacing your evidence with a self-calculated tariff total."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]
